.env
.env.*
!.env.example
node_modules/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
dist/
.cache/
.DS_Store
.data/

# IDE / session state (kept local only)
.workbuddy/
.claude/

# Web production build
apps/web/build/
apps/web/.react-router/

# Font package unpacked to regenerate the report nameplates (docs/customize.md)
package/
fontsource-noto-sans-sc-*.tgz

# Credentials. Whitelist, not blacklist: everything under secrets/ is ignored by
# default (so a stray plaintext file is never committed by accident), and only the
# encrypted archive plus its README are allowed through.
secrets/*
!secrets/credentials.env.enc
!secrets/README.md

# 交付文档的发布副本：线上按 /yihot/doc/<名字>.html 提供，不进公开仓库（正文源在 docs/）。
# 缺了它服务照常跑，只是该链接 404；换机重建前记得把文件放回去。
apps/web/docs-public/

# 临时导出：scripts/export-source-registry.py 的输入，每次现从库里导出，不入库
sources-export.tsv
